  "_registry": {
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "updated": "2026-07-29",
    "note": "THE source of truth for every contract the Cortex brain app reads. A contract = file + schema + producer + cadence + freshness SLO. Producers may only change ADDITIVELY within a major version. slo_seconds=null means no schedule exists for that producer: render the data's age, never claim it is fresh, never show a STALE badge (it is a static snapshot by design).",
    "deviation_from_gameplan_seed": "The gameplan's seed row 'pulse (svc/disk/queue/vpn)' is split here into one contract PER CARD (services, storage, pipeline, hnr, library-stats, plex-now, calendar, activity, health, security, smart) per architecture rule 'each card reads a named JSON contract' - independent SLOs, independent error states. Nothing was dropped."
